---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---
<Base
 currentPath="/contact/"
 title="Contact & Corrections - HT Calculator"
 description="Report a wrong price, fill a data gap, or suggest a Harvest Town calculator. Corrections usually ship within a week."
 path="/contact/"
 breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'Contact' }]}
>
 <Breadcrumbs crumbs={[{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'Contact' }]} />
 <h1>Contact and corrections</h1>
 <p class="value-line">The fastest way to improve these tools is to tell us what the game actually shows you.</p>

 <section class="prose">
 <h2>Report wrong or missing data</h2>
 <p>Email <strong>hello@harvesttowncalc.top</strong> with:</p>
 <ol>
 <li>The page or tool name (e.g. “crop calculator”);</li>
 <li>The item and the field (e.g. “Goose Feather sell price”);</li>
 <li>What the game shows, and - if you know - the quality tier.</li>
 </ol>
 <p>Data corrections usually ship within a week and are recorded in the <a href="/changelog/">changelog</a>. Especially valuable right now: feather and alpaca prices, seed prices for Wheat/Tomato/Sunflower/Napa Cabbage, and any star-quality fish prices.</p>

 <h2>Everything else</h2>
 <ul>
 <li><strong>Feature ideas</strong> (an orchard calculator? cooking profits?) - same address, put “idea” in the subject.</li>
 <li><strong>Rights-holder requests</strong> (asset licensing) - same address, marked urgent; we act promptly.</li>
 <li><strong>Privacy questions</strong> - see the <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> first; it’s short.</li>
 </ul>
 <p>Expected response time: a few days. We’re players with day jobs, not a support desk.</p>
 </section>
</Base>
